Result format (demo/v1): when you are done, call submit_result with a short `summary`
and a `detail` object that matches this JSON Schema:

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "required": [
    "projectName",
    "filesRead"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "projectName": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Name of the project"
    },
    "filesRead": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "string"
      },
      "description": "Paths of the files you read"
    }
  }
}
```

